## Start with the building blocks

A workspace gives your resources a home. A sandbox gives code an isolated place to run. A deployment turns a tested application into a version people can use. A computer adds a desktop when a task needs one.

You can learn these ideas without connecting an account. The examples and labs in this project run locally; production cloud operations belong to your own backend integration.

